  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Order carries attention",
    "overview": "Repomon keeps agent work in a dense, quiet desktop workspace. Home and Settings prioritize operating the fleet; Conversation combines a readable transcript ledger with the existing terminal and reply controls. The approved home and conversation references retain the incumbent chrome, with repo-leading home rows and bounded reading widths.",
